WEBVTT

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:26.560
The time has finally come.

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:30.150
The moment that I've been waiting for,
for one hundred years!

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:34.900
The time for the Dark Lord Angmund
to lay waste to this world...!

00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:01.440
The nocturnal sun overlaps the moon.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:04.190
Malduk opened the rift between dimensions,

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:07.600
and King Kyle appeared from within.

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:14.100
<i>When the red-stained night comes</i>

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:19.310
<i>I paint you on the sky</i>

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:29.730
"KING's RAID:
Successors of the Will"

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:34.150
<i>The hidden truth</i>

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:38.690
<i>The sudden suffocation</i>

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:43.940
<i>You are so distant, fading</i>

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:48.600
<i>Do you feel it too?</i>

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:50.940
<i>Crossing blades</i>

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:53.770
<i>Cannot touch</i>

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:58.440
<i>The sadness that lies beyond</i>

00:01:58.440 --> 00:02:00.940
<i>I just want to see you</i>

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:04.900
<i>I search for you</i>

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:08.310
<i>Now, Eclipse</i>

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:13.190
<i>I always want to be by your side</i>

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:15.850
<i>I send a wish to the sky</i>

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:18.060
<i>I believe in destiny</i>

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:20.480
<i>When the sun and moon meet</i>

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:22.940
<i>At that moment</i>

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:26.150
<i>I run to you</i>

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:30.020
<i>With all my heart</i>

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:43.930
<i></i>Illya's

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:43.930
<i></i>Truth

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.230
Is that...?!

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.480
K-Kyle...?

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:54.940
Kyle!

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:09.690
What's going on...?

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:21.150
Ah, now I see.

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:32.850
We welcome your arrival, Dark Lord.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.810
What are you talking about? This is--

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:39.600
Silence! This is the Dark Lord Angmund himself.

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:42.230
The destroyer of the world.

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:45.230
No...

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:51.190
Exalted one, we are almost
ready to destroy the world.

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:57.520
However, there is one
final matter to take care of...

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:07.310
We're almost at Mount Ogria.

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:10.690
I never imagined this cave had such a shortcut.

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:15.440
I know right? We'll get to
the World Tree in no time!

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:19.310
Now we'll finally get to unlock the final seal.

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:20.520
Yeah.

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:36.310
What is Riheet thinking?

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:42.190
Going to the Tower of the Sage to
acquire the False Sword, Illya's legacy...

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:45.770
Illya is a sinner. The fact that Riheet
wishes to rely on her legacy

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:49.560
suggests to me that he
is not thinking rationally.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:52.770
I can't speak for what's inside his mind.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:57.690
But I must go to the Tower of
the Sage to speak with Dominix.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:01.100
In order to find out how
to defeat the Dark Lord,

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:04.900
I have to meet with Dominix
directly and speak with him.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.560
Dominix was King Kyle's companion.

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:11.020
He must certainly have
information about the Dark Lord.

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:15.190
Your highness, travelling with
Riheet is dangerous!

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.560
Perhaps it is best to keep
your distance from him!

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:18.810
Demia...

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:22.850
After losing his friends,
he's been behaving strangely.

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:29.270
We hate Orvelia far more
than we hate the Demons!

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:34.770
Still, I can't leave him like this.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:37.770
No matter what he thinks of us.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:41.940
If you feel responsible for the
Black Edge being wiped out,

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:44.850
your highness, you must understand
that you are not at fault!

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:47.350
That's not the issue.

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:51.350
Anyway, it's just a short trip
to the Tower of the Sage.

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:53.770
I want you to trust me.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:58.690
I understand.

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:00.190
Thank you.

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:04.900
I will come back to join you as soon
as I am finished delivering the report.

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:07.520
Please take care.

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:10.900
Yes. Let's go... Riheet.

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:14.810
Take care of Orvelia for me, Demia.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:16.020
Yes!

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:24.770
Let us depart as well.

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:25.980
Yes!

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:45.480
I've been to the Tower of the Sage
once before, with my father.

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.560
How do we get up there?

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:48.850
Watch.

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:09.900
We're in the skies now.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:13.230
Dominix, the Great Sage, is in that tower.

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:19.730
It's been a while, Dominix.

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:22.350
Yes it has. Welcome, your highness.

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:31.350
You've grown so much.

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:35.940
The last time I met you,
you were just a small child.

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:40.650
True. And my father was healthy then.

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:44.190
This is Riheet, one of the
Guardian Knights of Orvelia.

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:47.440
I've come today to ask you a question.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:51.060
How to defeat the Dark Lord, correct?

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:53.690
Yes... But how?

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:58.060
What else can be so important to warrant
a visit from the princess herself?

00:07:58.060 --> 00:08:01.310
Besides, just the other day...

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:08.350
It seems like the dimensional rift was
opened and the Dark Lord has arrived.

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:10.230
Are you certain?

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:14.150
Yes. I can feel the Dark Lord's powers.

00:08:14.150 --> 00:08:19.810
Please tell me anything you know.
I don't care how trivial.

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:22.230
Very well.

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:24.100
However...

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:27.440
You seem to have a different
reason for being here.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.770
I heard Illya's laboratory is here.

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:32.190
Is that true?

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:34.520
Why do you ask?

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:37.440
For the Dark Elves, isn't Illya a hated--

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:43.980
I was also told that this belonged to Illya.

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:46.980
I want to know the truth. All of it.

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:49.350
I see.

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:51.190
Well, there's no reason
we should stay standing.

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:53.810
Please take a seat, I'll prepare some tea.

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:57.560
Where is the lab?! Show me!

00:08:57.560 --> 00:09:01.600
Very well. Follow me.

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:06.150
Over here.

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:15.020
This is Illya's lab.

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:17.650
Everything is as it was back then.

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:23.190
I will return to the princess.
You can spend as much time as you like.

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:27.480
Thank you for waiting.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:30.650
So, this is regarding the Dark Lord
and how to defeat him, yes?

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:32.190
Yes.

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:34.810
Let me get straight to the point.

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:40.600
The only way to defeat the Dark Lord
is by using the Holy Sword Aea,

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:42.940
which carries the power of Lua,
the Goddess of Light.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:47.650
But the Holy Sword is nowhere to be found.

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:49.770
Are you sure there's no other way?

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:54.440
We sealed the Holy Sword in a secret location.

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:58.060
Seal...? So it still exists?

00:09:58.060 --> 00:09:58.980
Yes.

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:01.440
Where is the Holy Sword now?

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:03.310
The World Tree.

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:07.480
The World Tree...
Why didn't you tell us until now?

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:10.400
To protect the Holy Sword from the Demons.

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:19.520
Also, we needed to hide the fact that the
Holy Sword Aea and its potential heir exist.

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:20.900
Heir...?

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:26.560
The Holy Sword Aea can only be
used by someone chosen by Lua.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:32.190
There is just one person who might
have been able to inherit that status.

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:34.270
Who is it?!

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:36.270
A young man named Kasel.

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:42.060
Kasel inherits the blood of King Kyle.

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:45.270
But King Kyle had no children...

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:49.400
King Kyle had a lover name Arlette.

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:55.230
Their relationship was torn apart,
but she carried his child in her.

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:57.020
That is Kasel.

00:10:57.020 --> 00:11:03.980
In order to inherit the Holy Sword,
Kasel slept for 100 years.

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:05.900
If people found out about Kasel,

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:10.440
it might lead to another conflict
surrounding the right of succession.

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:14.060
That was why we hid the fact from Orvelia.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:15.730
What do you mean, "another"?

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:19.730
When King Kyle went missing 100 years ago,

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:23.270
there was a huge conflict
regarding the right of succession.

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:28.900
The person who suffered the most from
this was Illya, King Kyle's half-sister.

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:36.980
Where is it?!

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:39.600
Where is the False Sword?!

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:54.270
Is this...?

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:58.690
This is a record of my technomagic research.

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:02.650
I hope this research will help Kyle...

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:10.900
I began this research after
Kyle's coronation ceremony.

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:14.690
I learned from a certain person that
a dimensional rift will open soon,

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:21.270
and that the Dark Lord Angmund
will appear from there.

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:27.650
The person also said that the Dark Lord
wishes to invade this world and destroy it.

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:30.480
However, we must not attempt
to defeat the Dark Lord.

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:35.850
The Dark Lord possesses a dark power
that can fight Lua, the Goddess of Light.

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:41.100
Anyone who tries to defeat the Dark Lord
will be overtaken by that power.

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:47.480
I searched through many pieces of
literature to find out if this was true.

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:53.810
However, no books discussed the
Dark Lord or his dark powers.

00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:57.400
Is the Dark Lord really appearing?

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:03.900
Though questions remain,
I must do my best to protect Kyle.

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:07.270
I decided to work on magical equipment

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:10.400
that can protect the wearer
from strong magical powers.

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:14.480
Magical equipment...? What is this?

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:18.850
I thought Illya was
working on a False Sword?

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:26.650
From that day on, I kept working on
researching and developing the equipment.

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:50.230
None of my prototypes were working out.

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:54.850
How can I protect the wearer
against the forces of darkness

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:57.730
without interfering with their own attacks?

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:00.270
I went through many iterations.

00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:06.480
Kyle, who is out hunting Demons, sent a letter.

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:09.600
He wrote that he was able to find
Arlette again in a refugee camp,

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:14.650
and that she was carrying his child.
He sounded very happy.

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:18.400
I was happy to learn that he was safe.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:22.150
I was also surprised to read the end
of the letter, where he told me

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:26.520
he received the Holy Sword Aea
from Lua, the Goddess of Light.

00:14:26.520 --> 00:14:31.770
He also received an oracle that the
Dark Lord Angmund is coming.

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:35.810
What she said was true...

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:39.400
I remembered seeing a passage
discussing Lua and Lea,

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:44.400
the goddesses of Light and Darkness,
in an ancient text, so I dug it up.

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:48.650
It is said that a realm of darkness
exists beyond a dimensional rift.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:51.690
Lea, the Goddess of Darkness,
is trying to destroy our world,

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:54.560
using the Demons that dwell in that realm.

00:14:54.560 --> 00:15:01.980
Lea is the goddess of destruction,
a counter to Lua, the goddess of creation.

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:06.100
It would be reasonable for us to fear Lea.

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:12.400
However, seen from a different angle,
Lea is not necessarily evil.

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:17.520
The foundation of this world is the
cycle of creation and destruction.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:22.310
According to that ancient text,
the battle between the two goddesses

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:25.690
have been going on for an
unfathomably long time.

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:32.230
Now, Lea is trying to release the Dark Lord
Angmund in order to destroy the world.

00:15:32.230 --> 00:15:37.270
I want to protect Kyle, who is doing
everything he can to protect the world.

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:40.350
I must finish development of this equipment.

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:47.350
The magic is finally complete.

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:50.190
But I don't have enough power.

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:52.810
I must hurry. Time is running out...

00:15:56.190 --> 00:15:57.980
This is it?

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:14.020
The same...

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:32.230
So what Illya was working on
was not the False Sword...?

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:39.980
Correct. The assertion that Illya
defiled Lua is completely false.

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:44.400
All she tried to do was to
protect her brother, King Kyle.

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:47.230
Then why was she found guilty in the trial?!

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:51.150
Because there were many who
wished to have her be guilty.

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:55.850
A group that wished to remove her clan,
a blood relative of the king, from power.

00:16:55.850 --> 00:16:57.480
No...

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:00.520
Riheet?

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:03.150
There is no False Sword!

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:05.940
You knew that, didn't you?!

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:13.980
Answer me! We went through so much
pain after Illya was found guilty...

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:18.940
If you had released the truth, so many
Dark Elf lives would have been spared!

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:20.400
Stop, Riheet!

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:27.770
I only learned about Illya's
research after she died.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:30.480
I was away from the
Tower of the Sage at the time,

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:34.230
travelling with King Kyle
to defeat the Dark Lord.

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:37.020
That's no excuse!

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:39.810
I did try to tell people the truth.

00:17:39.810 --> 00:17:42.520
But nobody listened.

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:47.730
Even the Dark Elves were blinded
by their hatred towards Illya.

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:52.980
Weren't you also convinced,
until just now, that Illya was guilty?

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:57.560
There was nothing I could say to change that.

00:17:57.560 --> 00:18:01.020
There was nothing we could do for Illya.

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:03.770
For what...?

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:09.190
We believed in Orvelia's lies
and hated Illya, for what?!

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:11.850
What have we been doing?!

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:30.690
Wow, so pretty!

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:35.270
This is a family charm. Our ancestors wore it.

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:39.060
Awesome! Let me wear it too!

00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:43.980
One day, it will be passed on to you.
Just wait until that day.

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:51.270
Illya... is our ancestor?!

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:59.350
Moves around like a living human!
Isn't it exquisite?

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:58.490
I can't make puppets if I
damage them too badly.

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:10.190
It's me. I'm coming in.

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:15.980
What do you want?

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:18.230
I read this too.

00:19:18.230 --> 00:19:22.650
Illya's research was all
about protecting King Kyle.

00:19:22.650 --> 00:19:27.100
This diary is full of her
thoughts towards King Kyle.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.350
I want the people of
Orvelia to learn about this.

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:34.230
Do as you like. It has nothing to do with me.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:38.100
Riheet, what are you going to do now?

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:44.650
If possible, I'd like you to join us as a
Guardian Knight, to defeat the Dark Lord.

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:48.980
How soft are you?
What makes you think I'll help you?

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:53.150
Leave me alone.

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:55.650
I can't let that happen.

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:59.270
Why, to atone for Orvelia's sins?

00:19:59.270 --> 00:20:01.440
Or do you feel sorry for us?

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:05.400
Neither. This is for Orvelia's future!

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:11.350
We must right the wrongs and improve
our relations with the Dark Elves.

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:14.810
Otherwise, similar tragedies would occur again.

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:22.520
I want to change Orvelia, into a nation
where the people can live in peace...

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:26.350
For that, we need the help of the Dark Elves.

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:30.270
Riheet, I need your help!

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:33.520
The False Sword we were
looking for didn't exist.

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:37.600
The world would end by the hands of the
Dark Lord before you can do anything.

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:43.270
There is still hope!
The Holy Sword Aea still exists.

00:20:43.270 --> 00:20:47.230
The heir to the Holy Sword is an
apprentice knight named Kasel.

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:53.730
Is it him...?

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.350
We must regroup with Kasel and help him.

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:59.020
That should bring us closer
to defeating the Dark Lord.

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:05.230
Where is the Holy Sword?!

00:21:06.520 --> 00:21:09.270
<i>This one wish</i>

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:11.980
<i>Connects you and me</i>

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:14.770
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:18.810
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:35.400
<i>A comfortable breeze passes over</i>

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:41.270
<i>A memory in a precious place</i>

00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:45.900
<i>From the day I decided to walk with you</i>

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:52.560
<i>The promise that I hid in my heart</i>

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:58.020
<i>I want to feel that moment, just once</i>

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:00.310
<i>If I stretch my arm out</i>

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:03.690
<i>I should be able to reach</i>
<i>the tomorrow in my dream</i>

00:22:03.690 --> 00:22:06.400
<i>This one wish</i>

00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:09.270
<i>I gently engrave in my heart</i>

00:22:09.270 --> 00:22:12.020
<i>The chain that connects the heart</i>

00:22:12.020 --> 00:22:14.810
<i>Cannot ever be broken</i>

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:17.600
<i>The future which we should head to</i>

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:20.350
<i>Beckons us to come closer</i>

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:23.190
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:26.150
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:22:45.480 --> 00:22:47.730
What's wrong?

00:22:47.730 --> 00:22:50.190
I feel dark energies expanding.

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:57.400
If you use the Holy Sword's power,
they will surely detect you.

00:22:57.400 --> 00:23:00.690
We aren't capable of fighting
the Dark Lord just yet.

00:23:00.690 --> 00:23:03.770
Kasel, until we reach the World Tree,

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:07.190
you must not, under any circumstances,
use the power of the Holy Sword.

00:23:08.270 --> 00:23:09.810
I understand.

00:23:09.810 --> 00:23:12.560
Don't worry, Kasel. We're here for you.

00:23:12.560 --> 00:23:17.270
Th-That's right!
I, the great sorceress, am here too!

00:23:17.270 --> 00:23:21.480
Bring it on, Dark Lord or whatever!

00:23:21.480 --> 00:23:23.850
Hey, Kasel...

00:23:23.850 --> 00:23:27.020
What's wrong, Frey?

00:23:27.020 --> 00:23:30.600
It's nothing... I'll do my best too!

00:23:30.600 --> 00:23:32.650
Yeah, let's go.

00:23:47.230 --> 00:23:53.270
Malduk detects the power of the
Holy Sword and chases after Kasel.

00:23:53.270 --> 00:24:00.600
Can we reach the World Tree
safely and unlock the final seal...?

00:23:58.330 --> 00:24:00.830
<i></i>To the

00:23:58.330 --> 00:24:00.830
<i></i>World Tree
